(498158, 48917, 8860, '<td valign="top">How strange that three of us thought the same thing!<br/> <br/>Nice hands, good capture, and an aesthetic composition. I do find the peripheral beads of water didtracting though and it would probably have made the shot look cleaner with only the water in the pool. Lighting is a little flat, but you''ve done well considering.</td>', 'How strange that three of us thought the same thing! Nice hands, good capture, and an aesthetic composition. I do find the peripheral beads of water didtracting though and it would probably have made the shot look cleaner with only the water in the pool. Lighting is a little flat, but you''ve done well considering.', '2003-11-29 03:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(498159, 48922, 8860, '<td valign="top">Off-putting title, put a nice snap despite being a bit noisy (the image I mean!).</td>', 'Off-putting title, put a nice snap despite being a bit noisy (the image I mean!).', '2003-11-29 04:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
