(498167, 48830, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.... so simple,yet so complete... I just love the composition and the theme. Not too sure about the shadows though... Maybe a bit harsh. But I would still give it a 10. I wish it ribbon!</td>', 'Wonderful.... so simple,yet so complete... I just love the composition and the theme. Not too sure about the shadows though... Maybe a bit harsh. But I would still give it a 10. I wish it ribbon!', '2003-11-29 04:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
