(498169, 48790, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! Nice, soft focus, soft and warm light. I can feel the pleasure of beeing home. Well done! I hope will be a ribbon. It deserves one.</td>', 'Wonderful! Nice, soft focus, soft and warm light. I can feel the pleasure of beeing home. Well done! I hope will be a ribbon. It deserves one.', '2003-11-29 04:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
