(498332, 48881, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, i like how you''ve framed the shot with the trees on either side. The quality doesnt look the best, and I''m wondering if this is because it seems a little soft, possibly handheld? If you look at the wall it looks a little tilted, but the perspective of the building is fairly good.</td>', 'Composition is good, i like how you''ve framed the shot with the trees on either side. The quality doesnt look the best, and I''m wondering if this is because it seems a little soft, possibly handheld? If you look at the wall it looks a little tilted, but the perspective of the building is fairly good.', '2003-11-29 10:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
