(498506, 48881, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a thing for which to be grateful! I love the colors here, and the quiet, peaceful feeling it evokes.</td>', 'This is certainly a thing for which to be grateful! I love the colors here, and the quiet, peaceful feeling it evokes.', '2003-11-29 12:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498507, 48790, 6870, '<td valign="top">Home is where you hang your hat! Nice, simple composition. Seems well balanced, too. More important, it gives off a feeling of home through your use of warm colors.</td>', 'Home is where you hang your hat! Nice, simple composition. Seems well balanced, too. More important, it gives off a feeling of home through your use of warm colors.', '2003-11-29 12:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(498509, 48914, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pretty gal! Tonal range is very nice. Centered composition works well.</td>', 'Pretty gal! Tonal range is very nice. Centered composition works well.', '2003-11-29 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(498510, 48883, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the texture made by the silvery grass blooms! Colors are not very saturated--have you tried this in B/W? It might work well. I love the peaceful, joyous feeling of this photo.</td>', 'I love the texture made by the silvery grass blooms! Colors are not very saturated--have you tried this in B/W? It might work well. I love the peaceful, joyous feeling of this photo.', '2003-11-29 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(498511, 48917, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Lighting is nice--perhaps just a tad harsh. I love the light bouncing around in the water in the hand.</td>', 'Fun shot. Lighting is nice--perhaps just a tad harsh. I love the light bouncing around in the water in the hand.', '2003-11-29 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(498512, 48830, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t drink wine, but I do love your shot anyway! It may be just a tad dark, but the simplicity of the composition and the direction of the shadows works very well. The background serves the shot well, too.</td>', 'I don''t drink wine, but I do love your shot anyway! It may be just a tad dark, but the simplicity of the composition and the direction of the shadows works very well. The background serves the shot well, too.', '2003-11-29 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(498514, 48905, 6870, '<td valign="top">Warmth is certainly something for which one can be grateful! Especially today when it''s 14 degrees outside! The supplemental lighting here (not the candle) is quiet and very, very effective. Candle is good, too, of course. This still may be just a tad dark, but I really like it.</td>', 'Warmth is certainly something for which one can be grateful! Especially today when it''s 14 degrees outside! The supplemental lighting here (not the candle) is quiet and very, very effective. Candle is good, too, of course. This still may be just a tad dark, but I really like it.', '2003-11-29 13:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(498516, 48863, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and I like the thing for which you''re grateful. I wonder if a watch is the best communication of home time, though. Still, I love the tones and composition here. 7</td>', 'Nice lighting and I like the thing for which you''re grateful. I wonder if a watch is the best communication of home time, though. Still, I love the tones and composition here. 7', '2003-11-29 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(498517, 48891, 6870, '<td valign="top">There you are, all dressed in white! Lovely family! I like the portrait, up-front composition for this. It is a formal presentation. The white reminds me of heaven, as if you were presenting your gratitude to a higher being.</td>', 'There you are, all dressed in white! Lovely family! I like the portrait, up-front composition for this. It is a formal presentation. The white reminds me of heaven, as if you were presenting your gratitude to a higher being.', '2003-11-29 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(498518, 48888, 6870, '<td valign="top">As far as I can tell, she IS perfect! I like the natural light here; it''s so pleasant and cozy. I do wish her head weren''t cropped off at the top. Have you tried this in B/W? It may stimulate even more emotive communication.  Nice work.</td>', 'As far as I can tell, she IS perfect! I like the natural light here; it''s so pleasant and cozy. I do wish her head weren''t cropped off at the top. Have you tried this in B/W? It may stimulate even more emotive communication.  Nice work.', '2003-11-29 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(498519, 48931, 6870, '<td valign="top">A nice, warm home in a cold, lovely environment. Good idea! Composition works well with the lighting and the trees as background.</td>', 'A nice, warm home in a cold, lovely environment. Good idea! Composition works well with the lighting and the trees as background.', '2003-11-29 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(498520, 48937, 6870, '<td valign="top">So am I! These are lovely orchids, and the lighting is very nice. Black background works well.</td>', 'So am I! These are lovely orchids, and the lighting is very nice. Black background works well.', '2003-11-29 13:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498521, 48833, 6870, '<td valign="top">A marvelous thing for which to be grateful. Perhaps the supreme example! I like how you spotlighed the scripture passage. Perhaps that''s enough. I''m not sure you needed to circle it with the chain? Still, a very nice image.</td>', 'A marvelous thing for which to be grateful. Perhaps the supreme example! I like how you spotlighed the scripture passage. Perhaps that''s enough. I''m not sure you needed to circle it with the chain? Still, a very nice image.', '2003-11-29 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(498522, 48883, 11769, '<td valign="top">What an impressive image. Fantastic. I believe it must be a wonderful place to live.</td>', 'What an impressive image. Fantastic. I believe it must be a wonderful place to live.', '2003-11-29 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(498523, 48947, 11769, '<td valign="top">Heartfelt, and very nice. Good composition, great idea. 10</td>', 'Heartfelt, and very nice. Good composition, great idea. 10', '2003-11-29 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(498525, 48847, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful conception. Photo appears not perfect but with only 48 hours the time constraints affected me to. Like the idea.</td>', 'Wonderful conception. Photo appears not perfect but with only 48 hours the time constraints affected me to. Like the idea.', '2003-11-29 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
