(498596, 48790, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the bunch.  If I could vote I''d probably give it a 9 or 10.  Good angles.  Very nice work.</td>', 'This is my favorite of the bunch.  If I could vote I''d probably give it a 9 or 10.  Good angles.  Very nice work.', '2003-11-29 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
