(498646, 48930, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice title here.  Shows a sad but good side.  Having a relative myself who''s come through this I know you thankful we all are that they are still around and doing fine.<br/> <br/>I would have liked the picture to be a little less blue, the tiles are blue, but his t-shirt looks too blue when it is grey.  Still, I really like this!  9</td>', 'Nice title here.  Shows a sad but good side.  Having a relative myself who''s come through this I know you thankful we all are that they are still around and doing fine. I would have liked the picture to be a little less blue, the tiles are blue, but his t-shirt looks too blue when it is grey.  Still, I really like this!  9', '2003-11-29 17:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(498662, 48946, 10818, '<td valign="top">I think the title was wrong.<br/>But its a great photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'I think the title was wrong.But its a great photo.  Nice job.', '2003-11-29 18:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(498685, 48883, 10702, '<td valign="top">Very very very nice.</td>', 'Very very very nice.', '2003-11-29 18:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(498688, 48917, 10702, '<td valign="top">Nice, I just love this one, very well done.</td>', 'Nice, I just love this one, very well done.', '2003-11-29 18:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(498689, 48806, 3032, '<td valign="top">You know, somehow I am trully grabbed by this portrait of your (?) dog.<br/>That eye, that eye, that cute hanging ear, that nose, that curled tail, who wouldn''t love a dog like that? :)<br/>Nice composition, good whitebalance and exposure. Easy to blow out the highlights on a subject like this. Good dof, good focus on the eye. The faint tail makes it 3D instead of a flat image. First pet pic I gave a 10 (that''s in about 13.000 votes).  :) You just grabbed that emotion of a pup in its new loving environment. Well done!<br/> <br/>And do I know the downside of a new pup, o man! Our last bouvier (belgian race: bouvier des flandres) used to shit in the kitchen and kick it all over the floor. The smell...........ooooooowwwwwwwwwbbbbbleeeeeeeeeeeeeeehhhhhhh. Guess who had to clean that up. :)</td>', 'You know, somehow I am trully grabbed by this portrait of your (?) dog.That eye, that eye, that cute hanging ear, that nose, that curled tail, who wouldn''t love a dog like that? :)Nice composition, good whitebalance and exposure. Easy to blow out the highlights on a subject like this. Good dof, good focus on the eye. The faint tail makes it 3D instead of a flat image. First pet pic I gave a 10 (that''s in about 13.000 votes).  :) You just grabbed that emotion of a pup in its new loving environment. Well done! And do I know the downside of a new pup, o man! Our last bouvier (belgian race: bouvier des flandres) used to shit in the kitchen and kick it all over the floor. The smell...........ooooooowwwwwwwwwbbbbbleeeeeeeeeeeeeeehhhhhhh. Guess who had to clean that up. :)', '2003-11-29 19:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(498690, 48932, 10510, '<td valign="top">Looks like is soooo thankful to have such wonderful parents.  Happy baby.  You are very fortunate to have such a wonderful child.  10</td>', 'Looks like is soooo thankful to have such wonderful parents.  Happy baby.  You are very fortunate to have such a wonderful child.  10', '2003-11-29 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498691, 48905, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Excellent exposure &amp; toning. Interesting subject and composition, good job on the lighting; I especially like it how you chose a shutter time that didn''t let the candle flame blow out the highlights of itself and its surroundings. The detail within the hands is therefore very good.<br/>This would perhaps also do very good in a 1:1 aspect ratio. Nice scene for a Medium Format camera.</td>', 'Good photo. Excellent exposure & toning. Interesting subject and composition, good job on the lighting; I especially like it how you chose a shutter time that didn''t let the candle flame blow out the highlights of itself and its surroundings. The detail within the hands is therefore very good.This would perhaps also do very good in a 1:1 aspect ratio. Nice scene for a Medium Format camera.', '2003-11-29 19:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(498695, 48821, 10510, '<td valign="top">My heart bleeds for our brave soldiers in Iraq - my son was one of them, but is safely home now.  I hope you are safe.</td>', 'My heart bleeds for our brave soldiers in Iraq - my son was one of them, but is safely home now.  I hope you are safe.', '2003-11-29 19:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(498698, 48860, 3032, '<td valign="top">Despite all the technical limitations: Highlight blowout, lens flare, noise in the shadows, I really like this scene. The composition and subject choice works great. I can definitely feel the joy of the little boy towards the dog. His forward positioning and expression express this.<br/>And there is just enough detail to see the joy of the girl about this. I can even imagine the way the father (or grandfather?) enjoys the boy''s encouter with animals. The dog seems excited too.<br/>It is photos like this that make me wish I had a little lad to take care off, it reminds me so much of my own youth (memory like an elephant). :)<br/>Verry happy scene, emotional. Well captured!</td>', 'Despite all the technical limitations: Highlight blowout, lens flare, noise in the shadows, I really like this scene. The composition and subject choice works great. I can definitely feel the joy of the little boy towards the dog. His forward positioning and expression express this.And there is just enough detail to see the joy of the girl about this. I can even imagine the way the father (or grandfather?) enjoys the boy''s encouter with animals. The dog seems excited too.It is photos like this that make me wish I had a little lad to take care off, it reminds me so much of my own youth (memory like an elephant). :)Verry happy scene, emotional. Well captured!', '2003-11-29 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(498699, 48839, 10510, '<td valign="top">Words can''t express my feeling of relief that Aubrey is home safe, even with the injuries that he sustained in Iraq, he will be okay.  This picture captures his happiness, and his love for Steffi.</td>', 'Words can''t express my feeling of relief that Aubrey is home safe, even with the injuries that he sustained in Iraq, he will be okay.  This picture captures his happiness, and his love for Steffi.', '2003-11-29 19:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(498700, 48883, 10510, '<td valign="top">Grow where you are planted.  I''m happy for you that you appreciate your beautiful surroundings.  This is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Grow where you are planted.  I''m happy for you that you appreciate your beautiful surroundings.  This is a beautiful photo.', '2003-11-29 19:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(498715, 48902, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  She looks so active.  Good composition and one of my favs for this challenge.  I gave it a 9</td>', 'Very nice photo.  She looks so active.  Good composition and one of my favs for this challenge.  I gave it a 9', '2003-11-29 19:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
