(498846, 48908, 11078, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute photo and I just want to hug him<br/>Definately someone to give thanks for. I think this is one of the top photos in my opinion not just because he is a cute baby but the image is sharp and lighting is good Its just a shame you chopped his head off at the top.He gets my vote!</td>', 'This is such a cute photo and I just want to hug himDefinately someone to give thanks for. I think this is one of the top photos in my opinion not just because he is a cute baby but the image is sharp and lighting is good Its just a shame you chopped his head off at the top.He gets my vote!', '2003-11-30 00:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(498847, 48814, 11078, '<td valign="top">Looks exciting but I think I would throw up I like to keep my feet on the ground Nice image though and good lighting</td>', 'Looks exciting but I think I would throw up I like to keep my feet on the ground Nice image though and good lighting', '2003-11-30 00:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(498849, 48806, 11078, '<td valign="top">Cute dog! Give him a hug from a doggie lover</td>', 'Cute dog! Give him a hug from a doggie lover', '2003-11-30 00:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498850, 48790, 11078, '<td valign="top">Great Idea and a really crisp clear image</td>', 'Great Idea and a really crisp clear image', '2003-11-30 00:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(498851, 48830, 509, '<td valign="top">Lovely studio shot.  I can''t think of a thing to change.  A little less lighting might create more of a mood, but I like it the way it is.  Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely studio shot.  I can''t think of a thing to change.  A little less lighting might create more of a mood, but I like it the way it is.  Nice work.', '2003-11-30 00:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
