(498857, 48930, 11078, '<td valign="top">Good on you! its a tough road but you look as if you are doing fine<br/>And everyday is something to be thankfor for and I hope you have many more healthy years ahead</td>', 'Good on you! its a tough road but you look as if you are doing fineAnd everyday is something to be thankfor for and I hope you have many more healthy years ahead', '2003-11-30 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
