(498884, 48883, 11078, '<td valign="top">Its a big image and I can only see about two thirds and then have to scroll up or down so its frustrating to look at as It looks a very beautiful image<br/>I like the colours and it looks a cold windy day.<br/> very nice</td>', 'Its a big image and I can only see about two thirds and then have to scroll up or down so its frustrating to look at as It looks a very beautiful imageI like the colours and it looks a cold windy day. very nice', '2003-11-30 03:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(498922, 48893, 14553, '<td valign="top">my new favorite! a very plain and clean picture with good perspective and good natural repetition!</td>', 'my new favorite! a very plain and clean picture with good perspective and good natural repetition!', '2003-11-30 08:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(498924, 48836, 14553, '<td valign="top">maybe more shots should have been taken of this activity and those submitted....focus needed a little help, maybe something we can focus or bring our eyes to....</td>', 'maybe more shots should have been taken of this activity and those submitted....focus needed a little help, maybe something we can focus or bring our eyes to....', '2003-11-30 08:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(498926, 48891, 14553, '<td valign="top">a good family portrait, the subject on the far right hair kind of is off from the rest but other than that it''s a good.</td>', 'a good family portrait, the subject on the far right hair kind of is off from the rest but other than that it''s a good.', '2003-11-30 08:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(498929, 48840, 7628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby, nice soft focus, very appropriate.  Wish there were a bit more light, a bit more contrast.  Maybe crop in more - frame the face closer from the left, bottom and right.  The blue background and the clothes, esp the cute little bear, don''t add anything, and distract from that angelic face.</td>', 'Beautiful baby, nice soft focus, very appropriate.  Wish there were a bit more light, a bit more contrast.  Maybe crop in more - frame the face closer from the left, bottom and right.  The blue background and the clothes, esp the cute little bear, don''t add anything, and distract from that angelic face.', '2003-11-30 08:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(498933, 48890, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice turkey, looks delicious, but the cropping and background seem very random, not thought out.  Maybe to have the turkey on a nicely set table, or surrounded by all the fixings, or on a dark background with steam rising up.</td>', 'Nice turkey, looks delicious, but the cropping and background seem very random, not thought out.  Maybe to have the turkey on a nicely set table, or surrounded by all the fixings, or on a dark background with steam rising up.', '2003-11-30 08:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(498937, 48860, 7628, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  What a moment you''ve captured, familiar to us all, but perhaps not cherished enough.  The glow of the beach light, the silver of the water catching these folks in almost silouette is perfect, Makes them less individuals and more archetypes - Woman, dog, baby, man - helps the viewer to put themselves in the place of your subjects.  I wish all of the shadows were included at the bottom and not cropped.  But lovely as it is. 8</td>', 'Adorable!  What a moment you''ve captured, familiar to us all, but perhaps not cherished enough.  The glow of the beach light, the silver of the water catching these folks in almost silouette is perfect, Makes them less individuals and more archetypes - Woman, dog, baby, man - helps the viewer to put themselves in the place of your subjects.  I wish all of the shadows were included at the bottom and not cropped.  But lovely as it is. 8', '2003-11-30 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498941, 48929, 7628, '<td valign="top">Snow?  The lighting is dramatic, and the subject almost abstract.  I find it interesting and magical, but the figures in the foreground and in front of the light are hard to identify.  My eyes want to make the carolers, but my brain isn''t convinced.  I think some more context would be helpful, and a bit more light to pick out the ornaments in the tree.</td>', 'Snow?  The lighting is dramatic, and the subject almost abstract.  I find it interesting and magical, but the figures in the foreground and in front of the light are hard to identify.  My eyes want to make the carolers, but my brain isn''t convinced.  I think some more context would be helpful, and a bit more light to pick out the ornaments in the tree.', '2003-11-30 08:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(498946, 48949, 7628, '<td valign="top">what a charming face!  You''ve done well to put him in a white shirt, and on a neutral background, without having it look posed, actually it looks quite spontanious.  His hair is beautifully crisp and shiny.  I wish the lighting on his face gave more shading it is a bit flat.  But overall it is a good portrait and would make a lovely holiday card!</td>', 'what a charming face!  You''ve done well to put him in a white shirt, and on a neutral background, without having it look posed, actually it looks quite spontanious.  His hair is beautifully crisp and shiny.  I wish the lighting on his face gave more shading it is a bit flat.  But overall it is a good portrait and would make a lovely holiday card!', '2003-11-30 08:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(498948, 48814, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun.  I like the colorful reflections in the water, blurred by the waters movement, and of course the blurr of the wheel.  I might crop in a bit more from the top and the right.  Less of that dark sky would pull our attention in more.  Having the wheel definitely off center creates a nice tension and I''d crop on the right rather thanthe left because I like the delicate distant lights moe than the solid gold of the building.</td>', 'Fun.  I like the colorful reflections in the water, blurred by the waters movement, and of course the blurr of the wheel.  I might crop in a bit more from the top and the right.  Less of that dark sky would pull our attention in more.  Having the wheel definitely off center creates a nice tension and I''d crop on the right rather thanthe left because I like the delicate distant lights moe than the solid gold of the building.', '2003-11-30 08:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(498949, 48883, 14193, '<td valign="top">I give thanks for that every day.</td>', 'I give thanks for that every day.', '2003-11-30 08:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(498952, 48833, 14193, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, and what better thing to be thankful for?</td>', 'Beautiful picture, and what better thing to be thankful for?', '2003-11-30 08:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(498953, 48898, 14193, '<td valign="top">Mine would say Olympus, but I know how you feel.</td>', 'Mine would say Olympus, but I know how you feel.', '2003-11-30 08:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(498955, 48830, 7628, '<td valign="top">good subject.  Nice red drape in the background.  The red wine is a little lost against all the red tho''.  I''d crop the bottom edge of the cutting board and on the right just loose the bright line in the cloth.  The lighting in a bit flat - more from the left or a white board to bounce the light back better?</td>', 'good subject.  Nice red drape in the background.  The red wine is a little lost against all the red tho''.  I''d crop the bottom edge of the cutting board and on the right just loose the bright line in the cloth.  The lighting in a bit flat - more from the left or a white board to bounce the light back better?', '2003-11-30 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(498956, 48890, 6870, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm. I could still eat turkey, even though I''ve been eating it for several days! This might look even more delicious in natural light. Try taking it outside, but in the shade or under a cloudy sky and you might get more natural colors. I think the centered composition works well here. I''m not so sure about the background.</td>', 'Mmmmmm. I could still eat turkey, even though I''ve been eating it for several days! This might look even more delicious in natural light. Try taking it outside, but in the shade or under a cloudy sky and you might get more natural colors. I think the centered composition works well here. I''m not so sure about the background.', '2003-11-30 08:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(498958, 48905, 14193, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite picture, I hope to see a blue ribbon next to it next week.</td>', 'This is my favorite picture, I hope to see a blue ribbon next to it next week.', '2003-11-30 08:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(498959, 48952, 6870, '<td valign="top">Water is certainly something I''m thankful for. We''ve had a drought for 5 years here in Utah. Unique photo and well captured. It doesn''t stir my emotions much, but I do like the shot very much.</td>', 'Water is certainly something I''m thankful for. We''ve had a drought for 5 years here in Utah. Unique photo and well captured. It doesn''t stir my emotions much, but I do like the shot very much.', '2003-11-30 08:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(498961, 48910, 7628, '<td valign="top">peaceful colors.  I like the atmopheric effect the blurred motion of the tree and the waves gives.  The balance is a bit off for me... I''d like to see the whole tree and more of the beach.  There is just too much sky, and the moon doesn''t fill it being so small and blurry.</td>', 'peaceful colors.  I like the atmopheric effect the blurred motion of the tree and the waves gives.  The balance is a bit off for me... I''d like to see the whole tree and more of the beach.  There is just too much sky, and the moon doesn''t fill it being so small and blurry.', '2003-11-30 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(498962, 48897, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ah yes. What better to respresent the warmth of home than a fire? Nice work. It would be nice to see the top of the flames, but I like this image and the idea behind it.</td>', 'Ah yes. What better to respresent the warmth of home than a fire? Nice work. It would be nice to see the top of the flames, but I like this image and the idea behind it.', '2003-11-30 08:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(498963, 48839, 14193, '<td valign="top">And we are all thankful for the service givin to this country! One of many true heroes.</td>', 'And we are all thankful for the service givin to this country! One of many true heroes.', '2003-11-30 09:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(498964, 48840, 6870, '<td valign="top">A practice for the soft-focus challenge? This child certainly does look like God''s little blessing! Soft focus works pretty well to give a ''soft'' feel to the image.</td>', 'A practice for the soft-focus challenge? This child certainly does look like God''s little blessing! Soft focus works pretty well to give a ''soft'' feel to the image.', '2003-11-30 09:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(498965, 48917, 14193, '<td valign="top">The detail in this picture is perfect, right down to the manicured nails!! Beautiful.</td>', 'The detail in this picture is perfect, right down to the manicured nails!! Beautiful.', '2003-11-30 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(498966, 48925, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting textures, tones and colors here. I''m trying to figure out what that round thing is. Is it a mushroom? Looks huge! I love the idea that nature is something for which we should be grateful. I''m not sure that your image presents an ideal or glorified look at nature, but it does show its reality quite nicely.</td>', 'Lots of interesting textures, tones and colors here. I''m trying to figure out what that round thing is. Is it a mushroom? Looks huge! I love the idea that nature is something for which we should be grateful. I''m not sure that your image presents an ideal or glorified look at nature, but it does show its reality quite nicely.', '2003-11-30 09:03:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(498968, 48839, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yay! Certainly something for which we should all be grateful--especially that woman. I like seeing his face, but I''d like to see more of the woman''s face and her gratitude. Nice tonal range and lighting here,too.</td>', 'Yay! Certainly something for which we should all be grateful--especially that woman. I like seeing his face, but I''d like to see more of the woman''s face and her gratitude. Nice tonal range and lighting here,too.', '2003-11-30 09:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(498969, 48908, 7628, '<td valign="top">Leifur the Lucky!  I hope!  Til hamingju.  What a rosey charmer!  I love the half a wink and that baby smile. The light has captured that beautiful soft baby skin.  You''ve maximized his face, and minimized the background - good - but wish we could have the top of his head too.</td>', 'Leifur the Lucky!  I hope!  Til hamingju.  What a rosey charmer!  I love the half a wink and that baby smile. The light has captured that beautiful soft baby skin.  You''ve maximized his face, and minimized the background - good - but wish we could have the top of his head too.', '2003-11-30 09:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(498970, 48835, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtapositon of flag and stained glass. I''m not sure the elements work together; they seem to be separate elements in a single frame, if that makes sense. Still, I love the idea, and your lighting and colors seem well composed.</td>', 'Interesting juxtapositon of flag and stained glass. I''m not sure the elements work together; they seem to be separate elements in a single frame, if that makes sense. Still, I love the idea, and your lighting and colors seem well composed.', '2003-11-30 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(498971, 48902, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''ve got a few explorers, too! Your use of fill-flash was a good choice here. I usuallydon''t light flash for humans, but in this image, it doesn''t seem to create harsh shadows and highlights like some flash photos do.</td>', 'I''ve got a few explorers, too! Your use of fill-flash was a good choice here. I usuallydon''t light flash for humans, but in this image, it doesn''t seem to create harsh shadows and highlights like some flash photos do.', '2003-11-30 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(498972, 48822, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this image. It is well composed and has some nice colors and good clarity, though I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be feeling due to you enigmatic title. Still, nice, clear work.</td>', 'I like this image. It is well composed and has some nice colors and good clarity, though I''m not sure what I''m supposed to be feeling due to you enigmatic title. Still, nice, clear work.', '2003-11-30 09:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(498973, 48893, 7628, '<td valign="top">Hello Carsten... or Alexander or Jonatan?  Elegant, peaceful, blanced, lovely range of grays. this pic is more about atmophere than a particular subject - my eye does feel a little lost wandering around this airy space, but that fits - isn''t spirituality a journey not a destination? 10</td>', 'Hello Carsten... or Alexander or Jonatan?  Elegant, peaceful, blanced, lovely range of grays. this pic is more about atmophere than a particular subject - my eye does feel a little lost wandering around this airy space, but that fits - isn''t spirituality a journey not a destination? 10', '2003-11-30 09:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(498974, 48814, 6870, '<td valign="top">Symbolic perhaps? If so, there are few clues that lead to know this. The image looks real enough, and has interesting colors. It is well composed and very engaging. Use of motion blur is very nicely done. The use of a cliche in the title leads me to believe that your work here is symbolic, but the point of view and presentation is very literal, so I''m just a tad confused. Still, very nice image.</td>', 'Symbolic perhaps? If so, there are few clues that lead to know this. The image looks real enough, and has interesting colors. It is well composed and very engaging. Use of motion blur is very nicely done. The use of a cliche in the title leads me to believe that your work here is symbolic, but the point of view and presentation is very literal, so I''m just a tad confused. Still, very nice image.', '2003-11-30 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(498975, 48822, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed by trees below and trees above.  Bright sunlit colors.  I''d crop some more on  the bottom the shadowy line of the path (or wall?0 is hard to figure out and just destracts from the picture.  Bit over sharpened? Would make a nice postcard.</td>', 'Nicely framed by trees below and trees above.  Bright sunlit colors.  I''d crop some more on  the bottom the shadowy line of the path (or wall?0 is hard to figure out and just destracts from the picture.  Bit over sharpened? Would make a nice postcard.', '2003-11-30 09:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(498976, 48821, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dog tags and boots are an interesting and unique pair of clues for me in your communication. I like the composition, too. And this is certainly something for which we should be grateful.</td>', 'Dog tags and boots are an interesting and unique pair of clues for me in your communication. I like the composition, too. And this is certainly something for which we should be grateful.', '2003-11-30 09:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(498978, 48873, 7628, '<td valign="top">You''ve got an interresting glow in your lighting - unearthly.  The shadow over his eye hides the details of what looks like a soft peaceful look.  I''m not sure of your choice of the blinds in the background - his face is so natural and organic, and they are so angular.  I''d like to see more of his head to the right and less of the blinds.</td>', 'You''ve got an interresting glow in your lighting - unearthly.  The shadow over his eye hides the details of what looks like a soft peaceful look.  I''m not sure of your choice of the blinds in the background - his face is so natural and organic, and they are so angular.  I''d like to see more of his head to the right and less of the blinds.', '2003-11-30 09:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(498980, 48884, 7628, '<td valign="top">A classic Thanksgiving candid.  One for the album, show those first girlfriends.  But technicaly it is a bit lacking.  The flash is bright and glaring and picks out details in the busy background that pull our eye away from the face, and leaves bold shadows in an unnatural way. The focus is a bit off.  His hand is cropped in the left in an odd way.  You''ve captured a moment, but not in any planed out way.</td>', 'A classic Thanksgiving candid.  One for the album, show those first girlfriends.  But technicaly it is a bit lacking.  The flash is bright and glaring and picks out details in the busy background that pull our eye away from the face, and leaves bold shadows in an unnatural way. The focus is a bit off.  His hand is cropped in the left in an odd way.  You''ve captured a moment, but not in any planed out way.', '2003-11-30 09:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(498981, 48853, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, worthy of thanks.  Wish your model were lit betterand in better focus, and I could see on her face how she feels about the freedom she is charged with.  Where is she going with it?  What will she do with it?  I get the light in the darkness and the seriousness, but I need more.</td>', 'An interesting idea, worthy of thanks.  Wish your model were lit betterand in better focus, and I could see on her face how she feels about the freedom she is charged with.  Where is she going with it?  What will she do with it?  I get the light in the darkness and the seriousness, but I need more.', '2003-11-30 09:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498992, 48924, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is something a lot of us are thankful for. I think a tighter crop would have improved this picture; the clutter on the desk is distracting.</td>', 'This is something a lot of us are thankful for. I think a tighter crop would have improved this picture; the clutter on the desk is distracting.', '2003-11-30 09:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
