(499033, 48883, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of shot I wanted to submit, but had neither the landscape or the time. It''s very well lit (good time of day) and the subdued colour assists the wistful feeling. Ever so slightly skewed clockwise. [9]</td>', 'This is the kind of shot I wanted to submit, but had neither the landscape or the time. It''s very well lit (good time of day) and the subdued colour assists the wistful feeling. Ever so slightly skewed clockwise. [9]', '2003-11-30 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
