(499410, 48917, 12253, '<td valign="top">The composition, tones and water capture is fantastic.  I think it would work better with the hands being softer (less skin detail) as might have been "legally" accomplished using NeatImage.</td>', 'The composition, tones and water capture is fantastic.  I think it would work better with the hands being softer (less skin detail) as might have been "legally" accomplished using NeatImage.', '2003-11-30 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499414, 48949, 12253, '<td valign="top">A good sharp capture with good tones, but I think you might have done better with some fill light in the front, which would have added some catchlights in his eyes, and brightened the lower part of his face a bit.  Also, I think the extra space should have been on the left not the right, just given the way he is slightly turned.</td>', 'A good sharp capture with good tones, but I think you might have done better with some fill light in the front, which would have added some catchlights in his eyes, and brightened the lower part of his face a bit.  Also, I think the extra space should have been on the left not the right, just given the way he is slightly turned.', '2003-11-30 20:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(499416, 48844, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the eyes.  I think the harsh flash or lighting on the skin detracts, some neat image softening might have been good here.</td>', 'Great capture of the eyes.  I think the harsh flash or lighting on the skin detracts, some neat image softening might have been good here.', '2003-11-30 20:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
