(500785, 48946, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused: this is your wife? Well, to the image: I love the emotive feel to this, and the natural expressions of doing normal but interesting things. The flash creates some very harsh highlights and shadows, though. You might experiment with just brightening up the room or shoot it outside in the shade where the light is bright and even.</td>', 'I''m a bit confused: this is your wife? Well, to the image: I love the emotive feel to this, and the natural expressions of doing normal but interesting things. The flash creates some very harsh highlights and shadows, though. You might experiment with just brightening up the room or shoot it outside in the shade where the light is bright and even.', '2003-12-02 00:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
