(502037, 48790, 10887, '<td valign="top">Good idea and nice picture.</td>', 'Good idea and nice picture.', '2003-12-03 05:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(502038, 48932, 10887, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-12-03 05:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(502101, 48824, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2003-12-03 07:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(502102, 48806, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely dog.</td>', 'Lovely dog.', '2003-12-03 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(502424, 48860, 6008, '<td valign="top">The reflection on the wet sand is a little too bright, especially around the guy''s head. Other than that it''s a good candid shot.</td>', 'The reflection on the wet sand is a little too bright, especially around the guy''s head. Other than that it''s a good candid shot.', '2003-12-03 12:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(502433, 48914, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a good portrait. Not an expert on portrait shots but from what I can tell it doesnt have any shadows on the face, which is good, the eyes are bright and fairly sharp, the skin tones are good, and the pose looks quite natural. I''m curious why you decided on black and white, though. I know b&amp;w can often even out skin tones, but with her bright smile and eyes and such a happy tone of the shot it seems to be screaming out for warm colors.</td>', 'It''s a good portrait. Not an expert on portrait shots but from what I can tell it doesnt have any shadows on the face, which is good, the eyes are bright and fairly sharp, the skin tones are good, and the pose looks quite natural. I''m curious why you decided on black and white, though. I know b&w can often even out skin tones, but with her bright smile and eyes and such a happy tone of the shot it seems to be screaming out for warm colors.', '2003-12-03 12:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(502437, 48893, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a great interior shot. The framing is excellent, very well balanced. The dark carpet and pews contrasts nicely with the lighter altar and ceiling. I also like the shadows cast across the carpet. It is also sharp enough for the fairly small details to be captured. Nicely captured.</td>', 'It''s a great interior shot. The framing is excellent, very well balanced. The dark carpet and pews contrasts nicely with the lighter altar and ceiling. I also like the shadows cast across the carpet. It is also sharp enough for the fairly small details to be captured. Nicely captured.', '2003-12-03 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(502450, 48946, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the angle, but the expression on the kid''s face is natural and good. Light is a little bright around his ear and a little on the kid''s shirt. It looks like a snapshot, which is why it probably will not score that highly, but the score only reflects the value of it in the contest, not on the value that it means to you and your family.</td>', 'Not a fan of the angle, but the expression on the kid''s face is natural and good. Light is a little bright around his ear and a little on the kid''s shirt. It looks like a snapshot, which is why it probably will not score that highly, but the score only reflects the value of it in the contest, not on the value that it means to you and your family.', '2003-12-03 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(502462, 48843, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the white wisps are or what they represent. The signed heart is a good idea and subject, although it''s a little dark. Like so many images in this challenge, it likely holds more emotional value with the photographer, but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Not sure what the white wisps are or what they represent. The signed heart is a good idea and subject, although it''s a little dark. Like so many images in this challenge, it likely holds more emotional value with the photographer, but it''s a good shot.', '2003-12-03 12:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(502466, 48911, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s not a bad portrait, it captures the silliness that your title suggests. No shadows on the face, although slightly soft, the lighting is ok.</td>', 'It''s not a bad portrait, it captures the silliness that your title suggests. No shadows on the face, although slightly soft, the lighting is ok.', '2003-12-03 12:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(502473, 48931, 6008, '<td valign="top">The cat really adds to it! Hrm, very picturesque, although a tad underexposed maybe. Not a huge fan of the angle, tho. The perspective makes what appears to be the horizon line tilted, and the emptyness on the left makes the crop on the right seem very tight, which unbalances the image. If the angle of the house can be corrected then I would say this could be christmas card worthy.</td>', 'The cat really adds to it! Hrm, very picturesque, although a tad underexposed maybe. Not a huge fan of the angle, tho. The perspective makes what appears to be the horizon line tilted, and the emptyness on the left makes the crop on the right seem very tight, which unbalances the image. If the angle of the house can be corrected then I would say this could be christmas card worthy.', '2003-12-03 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(502480, 48917, 6008, '<td valign="top">My first thought was that this had been neatimaged, or similar - there seems to be areas of very smooth smudges. I like the water in the hand, and a few of the waterdrops are nicely captured. Not sure about the sepia tone for this, though - it almost seems an unnatural coloring for the skin tone of the hands. Composition is ok, and the lighting/exposure is good.</td>', 'My first thought was that this had been neatimaged, or similar - there seems to be areas of very smooth smudges. I like the water in the hand, and a few of the waterdrops are nicely captured. Not sure about the sepia tone for this, though - it almost seems an unnatural coloring for the skin tone of the hands. Composition is ok, and the lighting/exposure is good.', '2003-12-03 12:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(502555, 48847, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a good moody shot - but too much foreground for me. There are some busy elements too - the birds, clutter of people, smoke plume, branches - which actually serve to distract from the image despite, in themselves, being quite emotive subjects.<br/> <br/>A beautiful scene and I can see why you wanted to be thankful for it!  ;)</td>', 'This is a good moody shot - but too much foreground for me. There are some busy elements too - the birds, clutter of people, smoke plume, branches - which actually serve to distract from the image despite, in themselves, being quite emotive subjects. A beautiful scene and I can see why you wanted to be thankful for it!  ;)', '2003-12-03 13:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(502556, 48949, 8860, '<td valign="top">He''s a good-looking, happy boy, so I can see why you''d be grateful. <br/> <br/>It''s a nice, mellow shot too but I would have cropped to the edge of his face on the right too and fully filled the frame, as there is no need for any space at all when you''re this close up.</td>', 'He''s a good-looking, happy boy, so I can see why you''d be grateful.  It''s a nice, mellow shot too but I would have cropped to the edge of his face on the right too and fully filled the frame, as there is no need for any space at all when you''re this close up.', '2003-12-03 13:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(502558, 48806, 8860, '<td valign="top">Cute little fella, but the shot is just too indistinct in the shadowed areas. Loss of DOF in the nose area is a shame.<br/> <br/>The crop is a bit awkward towards the bottom too. I would have gone portrait with this, cropped off the right side and filled the frame with pooch.</td>', 'Cute little fella, but the shot is just too indistinct in the shadowed areas. Loss of DOF in the nose area is a shame. The crop is a bit awkward towards the bottom too. I would have gone portrait with this, cropped off the right side and filled the frame with pooch.', '2003-12-03 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(502562, 48905, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well lit inside the hands but a bit too gloomy outside. The background to the right does nothing for the composition in my view and this may well have been improved by cropping tight and making it portrait.</td>', 'Well lit inside the hands but a bit too gloomy outside. The background to the right does nothing for the composition in my view and this may well have been improved by cropping tight and making it portrait.', '2003-12-03 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(502565, 48835, 8860, '<td valign="top">The picture speaks for itself here  and I find the title too verbose and overtly religious/patriotic - although I share the sentiment of gratitude for freedom.<br/> <br/> It''s a crisp, colourful shot. The flagpole is a bit intrusive at the top, but it''s very strong nonetheless.</td>', 'The picture speaks for itself here  and I find the title too verbose and overtly religious/patriotic - although I share the sentiment of gratitude for freedom.  It''s a crisp, colourful shot. The flagpole is a bit intrusive at the top, but it''s very strong nonetheless.', '2003-12-03 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(502568, 48840, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a little cutie! This picture will never win a ribbon and neither is it technically good, but with subject matter like this - who cares?! No wonder you''re grateful.  :)</td>', 'What a little cutie! This picture will never win a ribbon and neither is it technically good, but with subject matter like this - who cares?! No wonder you''re grateful.  :)', '2003-12-03 13:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(502575, 48790, 8860, '<td valign="top">Although a technically crisp shot this feels like anywhere but home. I understand your sentiment, but it needs to have more homely context for me.<br/> <br/>Good composition and focus.</td>', 'Although a technically crisp shot this feels like anywhere but home. I understand your sentiment, but it needs to have more homely context for me. Good composition and focus.', '2003-12-03 13:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(502902, 48947, 10763, '<td valign="top">Great Pic! It shows lots of love in this family. I would give u a 10 if i could!</td>', 'Great Pic! It shows lots of love in this family. I would give u a 10 if i could!', '2003-12-03 19:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(503026, 48847, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great setting...I might have cropped the bottom a little more.</td>', 'Great setting...I might have cropped the bottom a little more.', '2003-12-03 21:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(503028, 48883, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very well done...excellent scene.</td>', 'Very well done...excellent scene.', '2003-12-03 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(503032, 48917, 8637, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful capture...very well done!  Got to be a ribbon.</td>', 'What a beautiful capture...very well done!  Got to be a ribbon.', '2003-12-03 21:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(503107, 48883, 14749, '<td valign="top">Lovely Photo!</td>', 'Lovely Photo!', '2003-12-03 23:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(503158, 48917, 14751, '<td valign="top">I love the detail present in this photograph, with even the ripples seeming frozen despite the obvious, inherent motion.</td>', 'I love the detail present in this photograph, with even the ripples seeming frozen despite the obvious, inherent motion.', '2003-12-04 00:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(503255, 48917, 14715, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  The color and motion in it are perfect.  I really don''t have any thing to ''add'' so to say.  You nailed this one</td>', 'I really like this picture.  The color and motion in it are perfect.  I really don''t have any thing to ''add'' so to say.  You nailed this one', '2003-12-04 05:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(503256, 48818, 14715, '<td valign="top">The colors are what drew me to this photo, and I enjoy it very much.</td>', 'The colors are what drew me to this photo, and I enjoy it very much.', '2003-12-04 05:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(503257, 48929, 14715, '<td valign="top">Hard to understand the content matter.  I assume its a tree being dedicated outside in the snow through a crowd.</td>', 'Hard to understand the content matter.  I assume its a tree being dedicated outside in the snow through a crowd.', '2003-12-04 05:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(503258, 48891, 14715, '<td valign="top">Very nice family portrait.</td>', 'Very nice family portrait.', '2003-12-04 05:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(503259, 48860, 14715, '<td valign="top">Great content.  The light coming off of the water in the upper right side is a bit much though.</td>', 'Great content.  The light coming off of the water in the upper right side is a bit much though.', '2003-12-04 05:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(503554, 48917, 8171, '<td valign="top">This one is bound to be up there - lovely tones, clear water and frozen time - well done all round - 9</td>', 'This one is bound to be up there - lovely tones, clear water and frozen time - well done all round - 9', '2003-12-04 13:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(503566, 48833, 8171, '<td valign="top">A very thoughtful idea and presentation of it. Well done - 9</td>', 'A very thoughtful idea and presentation of it. Well done - 9', '2003-12-04 13:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(503618, 48925, 14764, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this type of photo!  I take them too!  So many things go unnoticed "below eyelevel" and it is so IMPORTANT to stop and appreciate the many gifts we have been given!  Thanks for the DETAILS!!  best regards, Dar Pinson (darudy@juno.com)</td>', 'I LOVE this type of photo!  I take them too!  So many things go unnoticed "below eyelevel" and it is so IMPORTANT to stop and appreciate the many gifts we have been given!  Thanks for the DETAILS!!  best regards, Dar Pinson (darudy@juno.com)', '2003-12-04 14:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(503734, 48947, 14211, '<td valign="top">like the way the fingers form hearts.....obviously a loving family.</td>', 'like the way the fingers form hearts.....obviously a loving family.', '2003-12-04 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(503740, 48930, 14211, '<td valign="top">touches the heart .....the smile is an inspiration.</td>', 'touches the heart .....the smile is an inspiration.', '2003-12-04 16:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(503742, 48917, 14211, '<td valign="top">love the drops of water and the thought.</td>', 'love the drops of water and the thought.', '2003-12-04 16:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(503744, 48830, 14211, '<td valign="top">Me too!</td>', 'Me too!', '2003-12-04 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(503748, 48898, 14211, '<td valign="top">GOOD THINKING.</td>', 'GOOD THINKING.', '2003-12-04 17:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(503751, 48949, 14211, '<td valign="top">LOVE THAT SMILE and the eyes.</td>', 'LOVE THAT SMILE and the eyes.', '2003-12-04 17:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(503982, 48917, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, clarity is superb! 9</td>', 'Very nice photo, clarity is superb! 9', '2003-12-04 19:16:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(503990, 48830, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation of the challenge. Lighting, color and composition are well done. It looks like some details are lost on the right side where the folds of the velvet made it look like it was the edge of the cloth. 8</td>', 'Very nice interpretation of the challenge. Lighting, color and composition are well done. It looks like some details are lost on the right side where the folds of the velvet made it look like it was the edge of the cloth. 8', '2003-12-04 19:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(503993, 48891, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice family photo. Despite the high contrast nothing is blown out. Beautiful. 7</td>', 'Very nice family photo. Despite the high contrast nothing is blown out. Beautiful. 7', '2003-12-04 19:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(503998, 48893, 12160, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful, very serene place. Symmetry works well. Love the b&amp;w rendition.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful, very serene place. Symmetry works well. Love the b&w rendition.', '2003-12-04 19:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(504151, 48930, 1379, '<td valign="top">You get a 10 for this portrait.  I don''t care a bit about your lighting or composition.....  It''s the spirit of your photo (and the spirit of your survivor) that move me.  Awesome.</td>', 'You get a 10 for this portrait.  I don''t care a bit about your lighting or composition.....  It''s the spirit of your photo (and the spirit of your survivor) that move me.  Awesome.', '2003-12-04 22:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(504154, 48925, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Your colors are incredible, especially the vibrant green in the foreground.  And yes, we should ALL give thanks to mother nature.</td>', 'Awesome.  Your colors are incredible, especially the vibrant green in the foreground.  And yes, we should ALL give thanks to mother nature.', '2003-12-04 22:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(504156, 48828, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate highlights and the slightly soft focus for this.  The catchlights in their eyes make it seem very intimate.  Your choice of b/w was great!  You earned a 10 in my book.</td>', 'I love the delicate highlights and the slightly soft focus for this.  The catchlights in their eyes make it seem very intimate.  Your choice of b/w was great!  You earned a 10 in my book.', '2003-12-04 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(504193, 48931, 10818, '<td valign="top">I really love the snow, the tall trees and the cat by the garage.  The house was cut off a bit, but I think its a very nice job.</td>', 'I really love the snow, the tall trees and the cat by the garage.  The house was cut off a bit, but I think its a very nice job.', '2003-12-04 22:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504209, 48860, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great emotive shot.  It mght have been good to capture the whole shadows in the foreground, and to meter off of the brighter areas to eliminate the overexposure and blooming at the top right.  The subjects work well as sillouettes, so they can be darker without loss of the impact.  Nice catch.</td>', 'Great emotive shot.  It mght have been good to capture the whole shadows in the foreground, and to meter off of the brighter areas to eliminate the overexposure and blooming at the top right.  The subjects work well as sillouettes, so they can be darker without loss of the impact.  Nice catch.', '2003-12-04 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(504210, 48806, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the dog, I know they aren''t easy!  What kind of dog is this?</td>', 'Good shot of the dog, I know they aren''t easy!  What kind of dog is this?', '2003-12-04 23:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(504212, 48826, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and well done.  Did you consider having for the foot coming in at an angle compositionally, and did you try a softer focus?  I think that might have improved it personally,   Little feet are soft, but the sharpness here makes this look adult.  Also, the ring showing through would have been better if not there, and even for sharp focus, the lighting is a bit harsh and reflective.</td>', 'Good idea, and well done.  Did you consider having for the foot coming in at an angle compositionally, and did you try a softer focus?  I think that might have improved it personally,   Little feet are soft, but the sharpness here makes this look adult.  Also, the ring showing through would have been better if not there, and even for sharp focus, the lighting is a bit harsh and reflective.', '2003-12-04 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(504213, 48902, 12253, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  I would suggest cropping the top to make her even more significant in the frame and put her head in the top 1/3..  Also, she''s very nicely lit, but the surroundings could be a bit brighter.</td>', 'Cute shot.  I would suggest cropping the top to make her even more significant in the frame and put her head in the top 1/3..  Also, she''s very nicely lit, but the surroundings could be a bit brighter.', '2003-12-04 23:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(504217, 48898, 12253, '<td valign="top">?  There are so many natural and truly important things to be thankful for-- but it''s your thanks.  <br/> <br/>I find the shallow depth of field doesn''t work well for me here.  There just doesn''t seem to be much to the photo, and it doesn''t work aesthetically because of the DOF and upper left glare, at least for me.</td>', '?  There are so many natural and truly important things to be thankful for-- but it''s your thanks.   I find the shallow depth of field doesn''t work well for me here.  There just doesn''t seem to be much to the photo, and it doesn''t work aesthetically because of the DOF and upper left glare, at least for me.', '2003-12-04 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(504218, 48832, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot of your daughter, I think you could have given it more impact by a different crop.    The arm is distracting, so it might have been a good one to try a "real crop chop" and use part of her face and head.  Sometimes that works really well, or maybe you had another shot wiithout the hand.  Moving her off center would halp too (and that would happen with the crop.)</td>', 'Good shot of your daughter, I think you could have given it more impact by a different crop.    The arm is distracting, so it might have been a good one to try a "real crop chop" and use part of her face and head.  Sometimes that works really well, or maybe you had another shot wiithout the hand.  Moving her off center would halp too (and that would happen with the crop.)', '2003-12-04 23:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(504220, 48929, 12253, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very special shot but I am having trouble making out what I am looking at.  I see the tree, and snow, and a very birght overexposed light.  I assume those are heads, and you are in a crowd of carolers or a service of some sort (sorry, christmas isn''t part of my religion or lack of it).  Shot wise,  the most important thing I see is to fix or get rid of the light.  I realize you can''t fix it within the challenge rules though, and you may not have wanted to crop if that was important to your message..  If you had more of the heads on the bottom, you might have been able to just crop the left.</td>', 'This looks like a very special shot but I am having trouble making out what I am looking at.  I see the tree, and snow, and a very birght overexposed light.  I assume those are heads, and you are in a crowd of carolers or a service of some sort (sorry, christmas isn''t part of my religion or lack of it).  Shot wise,  the most important thing I see is to fix or get rid of the light.  I realize you can''t fix it within the challenge rules though, and you may not have wanted to crop if that was important to your message..  If you had more of the heads on the bottom, you might have been able to just crop the left.', '2003-12-04 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(504222, 48910, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and good "thanks" message.<br/> <br/>Technically,  I think this might have worked better as a landscape.  I find too much space at the top above the moon, and overall too much blue sky.  Also, I note that the horizon is tilted.  I think it would have been better with enough DOF to have the tree sharp as well.</td>', 'Wonderful light and good "thanks" message. Technically,  I think this might have worked better as a landscape.  I find too much space at the top above the moon, and overall too much blue sky.  Also, I note that the horizon is tilted.  I think it would have been better with enough DOF to have the tree sharp as well.', '2003-12-04 23:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(504224, 48890, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good colors and tones for the bird.  I think the composition could have been improved by getting rid of distractions like the counter behind, and maybe providing a wonderful context like a fully set table with flowers and the bird as the centerpiece.</td>', 'Good colors and tones for the bird.  I think the composition could have been improved by getting rid of distractions like the counter behind, and maybe providing a wonderful context like a fully set table with flowers and the bird as the centerpiece.', '2003-12-04 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(504226, 48891, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful family shot with very nice light and tones.  I think some back light or fill light at the top so the your hair doesn''t disappear into the background would have been a nice finishing touch.</td>', 'Beautiful family shot with very nice light and tones.  I think some back light or fill light at the top so the your hair doesn''t disappear into the background would have been a nice finishing touch.', '2003-12-04 23:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(504228, 48908, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and expression.  I think it might have been interesting to crop a little more at the top to make the crop you chose a little stronge, giving his expression more importance in the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and expression.  I think it might have been interesting to crop a little more at the top to make the crop you chose a little stronge, giving his expression more importance in the frame.', '2003-12-04 23:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(504230, 48953, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, one of my favorite compositions.  I think though, since they are facing so much to the left, the shot is a bit too imbalanced with that being out of the photo.  If they were looking/facing a bit more right, the comp would be perfect.  For this stance,  I think I would have put them on the right of the frame.</td>', 'Very nice shot, one of my favorite compositions.  I think though, since they are facing so much to the left, the shot is a bit too imbalanced with that being out of the photo.  If they were looking/facing a bit more right, the comp would be perfect.  For this stance,  I think I would have put them on the right of the frame.', '2003-12-04 23:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(504243, 48953, 10818, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful photograph.  10.</td>', 'What a wonderful photograph.  10.', '2003-12-04 23:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(504250, 48873, 6804, '<td valign="top">Friends really are something to be thankful for. I like this shot. The subtle background is nice and the angle of the shot gives the feeling of looking after a friend in need. Good Work !</td>', 'Friends really are something to be thankful for. I like this shot. The subtle background is nice and the angle of the shot gives the feeling of looking after a friend in need. Good Work !', '2003-12-05 00:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(504255, 48833, 6804, '<td valign="top">Yes, I''m certainly thankful for Jesus. I like the soft color tones to this. The dark drop-out background works well and I love the lighting of the scripture. My only suggestion would be that it appears a little blurred. I''m not sure if it''s from over sharp or just focus??   Over-all, a very nice shot.</td>', 'Yes, I''m certainly thankful for Jesus. I like the soft color tones to this. The dark drop-out background works well and I love the lighting of the scripture. My only suggestion would be that it appears a little blurred. I''m not sure if it''s from over sharp or just focus??   Over-all, a very nice shot.', '2003-12-05 00:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(504258, 48893, 6804, '<td valign="top">What a clean shot! This is beautiful work. I rarely center my subjects as you have here. I think it works well on this shot and you''ve made a good choice. I favor ambient light in architectural work and you''ve hit this perfectly without blowing out the highlights. 10</td>', 'What a clean shot! This is beautiful work. I rarely center my subjects as you have here. I think it works well on this shot and you''ve made a good choice. I favor ambient light in architectural work and you''ve hit this perfectly without blowing out the highlights. 10', '2003-12-05 00:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(504259, 48891, 6804, '<td valign="top">A wonderful family portrait. My only suggestion here would be just a dash of backlight to define the dark hair from the background. You should be proud of this!  10</td>', 'A wonderful family portrait. My only suggestion here would be just a dash of backlight to define the dark hair from the background. You should be proud of this!  10', '2003-12-05 00:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(504260, 48908, 6804, '<td valign="top">:) Great shot ! I would crop just a little tighter on the right to center the little man. Or open up on the left just a tad.  Still a great shot.</td>', ':) Great shot ! I would crop just a little tighter on the right to center the little man. Or open up on the left just a tad.  Still a great shot.', '2003-12-05 00:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(504263, 48847, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful capture. I like the soft focus here and I know how difficult it is to shoot into the sun as you have. I just want to give this a little saturation or contrast I think. It''s just a personal preference and I know it could be the difference between our monitors as well.</td>', 'This is a beautiful capture. I like the soft focus here and I know how difficult it is to shoot into the sun as you have. I just want to give this a little saturation or contrast I think. It''s just a personal preference and I know it could be the difference between our monitors as well.', '2003-12-05 00:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(504320, 48814, 12802, '<td valign="top">Maybe this should would have looked better had  there been more of the water and reflections in the shot.  There is about an inch of black at the top of the picture, moving the whole thing up a tab would have given us more of the colours in the water.<br/> <br/>A very nice picture though, I love long exposure shots at night (Expecially such great colours as thins!)<br/> <br/>Because of the space at the top i''m dropping 1 point, but you get a 9 from me.</td>', 'Maybe this should would have looked better had  there been more of the water and reflections in the shot.  There is about an inch of black at the top of the picture, moving the whole thing up a tab would have given us more of the colours in the water. A very nice picture though, I love long exposure shots at night (Expecially such great colours as thins!) Because of the space at the top i''m dropping 1 point, but you get a 9 from me.', '2003-12-05 02:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(504325, 48812, 12802, '<td valign="top">Maybe if your Mum was sitting up a little higher so that both of their necklines were visable?  Nice use of empty negative spave and B&amp;W. Your Dad looks comfortable doing this, your Mum doesn''t though. (My Mum would never dream of getting her photo done like this...) 8</td>', 'Maybe if your Mum was sitting up a little higher so that both of their necklines were visable?  Nice use of empty negative spave and B&W. Your Dad looks comfortable doing this, your Mum doesn''t though. (My Mum would never dream of getting her photo done like this...) 8', '2003-12-05 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(504357, 48908, 1031, '<td valign="top">He''s gonna be one dangerous kid if he''s starting to flirt with the audience already!</td>', 'He''s gonna be one dangerous kid if he''s starting to flirt with the audience already!', '2003-12-05 05:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(504404, 48812, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of this speed challenge.  The lighting is the bomb. The focus is perfect.  The expressions (lack there-of) priceless.  Negative space imperitive.  I even like the border.  If this ain''t a ribbon...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is my favorite of this speed challenge.  The lighting is the bomb. The focus is perfect.  The expressions (lack there-of) priceless.  Negative space imperitive.  I even like the border.  If this ain''t a ribbon...TC', '2003-12-05 08:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(504407, 48888, 9906, '<td valign="top">The ONLY things I don''t like here are:  It''s a touch grainy.  I wish you woulda got the top of her precious little head.  Compositionally It''s a touch busy but I can live with this here!  Nice ''snapshot''<br/>TC</td>', 'The ONLY things I don''t like here are:  It''s a touch grainy.  I wish you woulda got the top of her precious little head.  Compositionally It''s a touch busy but I can live with this here!  Nice ''snapshot''TC', '2003-12-05 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(504415, 48917, 9906, '<td valign="top">On a personal level, I think that this is a little deep for the current challenge, but I don''t know where you are from or what your culture does for this holiday if anything...  I can''t fault the image too much though.  You have a couple of spots in the bakground above the right hand thumb.  You managed to light it up nicely without getting hardly any overexposure (KUDOS for that alone.  I''m trying to get through my lighting issues.)  Cropping is a little tight (is this straight out of camera?)  Your focus is damn near perfect without being over sharp and I LOVE your choice of a sepia style here.  Nice!  Gotta be top 5.<br/>TC</td>', 'On a personal level, I think that this is a little deep for the current challenge, but I don''t know where you are from or what your culture does for this holiday if anything...  I can''t fault the image too much though.  You have a couple of spots in the bakground above the right hand thumb.  You managed to light it up nicely without getting hardly any overexposure (KUDOS for that alone.  I''m trying to get through my lighting issues.)  Cropping is a little tight (is this straight out of camera?)  Your focus is damn near perfect without being over sharp and I LOVE your choice of a sepia style here.  Nice!  Gotta be top 5.TC', '2003-12-05 08:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(504478, 48790, 14781, '<td valign="top">Very simply put, something too many people take for granted.</td>', 'Very simply put, something too many people take for granted.', '2003-12-05 10:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(504525, 48821, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of the few entries which evokes (for me) an emotional response AND holds visual appeal. Lighting on the tags is a little harsh. Composition/ close crop is interesting.</td>', 'One of the few entries which evokes (for me) an emotional response AND holds visual appeal. Lighting on the tags is a little harsh. Composition/ close crop is interesting.', '2003-12-05 11:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(504531, 48839, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting though, great expressions, good composition. I don''t usually like portraits without eyes showing but here it just emphasises how they have eyes only for each other.</td>', 'Nice lighting though, great expressions, good composition. I don''t usually like portraits without eyes showing but here it just emphasises how they have eyes only for each other.', '2003-12-05 11:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
