(504962, 48911, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beyond the humourous expression there is little of interest here for me. I totally understand your devotion and gratitude, therefore fitting the challenge, but for me it needs to be a more interesting shot.<br/> <br/>The flash lighting is flat, causing unwanted shadow and the colours are a bit washed out.</td>', 'Beyond the humourous expression there is little of interest here for me. I totally understand your devotion and gratitude, therefore fitting the challenge, but for me it needs to be a more interesting shot. The flash lighting is flat, causing unwanted shadow and the colours are a bit washed out.', '2003-12-05 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(504965, 48814, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot which makes this look like it goes MUCH faster than it really does! A little more context would have given it more suggestion of size - or coming in closer may have been more impressive.<br/> <br/>Still a great shot anyway.</td>', 'Nice clean shot which makes this look like it goes MUCH faster than it really does! A little more context would have given it more suggestion of size - or coming in closer may have been more impressive. Still a great shot anyway.', '2003-12-05 19:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(504967, 48833, 8860, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit too religious and cliched this one - for me anyway. Nice composition, if a little noisy.</td>', 'It''s a bit too religious and cliched this one - for me anyway. Nice composition, if a little noisy.', '2003-12-05 19:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(504971, 48827, 8860, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge but it''s a bit dull, colourless and the lighting is very flat and uneasy on the eye. It''s basically a snap shot with a positive sentiment.</td>', 'This fits the challenge but it''s a bit dull, colourless and the lighting is very flat and uneasy on the eye. It''s basically a snap shot with a positive sentiment.', '2003-12-05 19:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(504975, 48931, 8860, '<td valign="top">Despite being skewed clockwise this is a pleasant home in a lovely environment - so I understand the sentiment and it fits the challenge. Not much else of interest though. <br/> <br/>Lighting on the house is quite flat, so maybe switching some lights on inside would have made it look more welcoming - even waiting until it got a bit darker perhaps.<br/> <br/>Makes me keen to get on my snowboard though!  ;)</td>', 'Despite being skewed clockwise this is a pleasant home in a lovely environment - so I understand the sentiment and it fits the challenge. Not much else of interest though.  Lighting on the house is quite flat, so maybe switching some lights on inside would have made it look more welcoming - even waiting until it got a bit darker perhaps. Makes me keen to get on my snowboard though!  ;)', '2003-12-05 19:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(504976, 48824, 8860, '<td valign="top">Now this IS a happy fella. He must mean much to you to thank him so much, so good on you.<br/> <br/>Nicely lit but the composition may as well have filled the frame as the space at the top is inactive.</td>', 'Now this IS a happy fella. He must mean much to you to thank him so much, so good on you. Nicely lit but the composition may as well have filled the frame as the space at the top is inactive.', '2003-12-05 19:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(504979, 48929, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is a very festive scene with an interesting viewpoint. Title does nothing for me but the image is lovely with some nice focus although that light is just slightly too overexposed.</td>', 'This is a very festive scene with an interesting viewpoint. Title does nothing for me but the image is lovely with some nice focus although that light is just slightly too overexposed.', '2003-12-05 19:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(504984, 48914, 8860, '<td valign="top">... and so you should be! She''s got a very friendly, kind face.  ;)<br/> <br/>The shot is OK with some soft, mellow lighting - a nice, natural portrait.<br/> <br/></td>', '... and so you should be! She''s got a very friendly, kind face.  ;) The shot is OK with some soft, mellow lighting - a nice, natural portrait. ', '2003-12-05 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
