(505338, 48917, 5475, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kosmikkreeper:</b></div><hr/><i>YAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>*clears his troat as he walks up to the podium*<br/> <br/>I would like to thank DPC for giving me the opportunity to let my imagination run free. Without DPC I wouldn''t be the photogrpaher that I am today.<br/> <br/>I would like to thank my girlfriend for being sooooooooooo patient with me (and often being my model) and understanding my passion for this wonderful art. <br/> <br/>I would like to thank my mom and my dad for bringing me into this world. <br/> <br/>But most of all.... thank you to all the DPCers for voting my shot into glory!!!! *tear comes to his eye*<br/> <br/>Go team Coolpix 4500!!!!!!!!! Wait a minute... I might be the only one!!!! ;-)<br/> <br/>Yanik<br/> <br/>*leaves the stage with the BLUE RIBBON glued on his forehead*</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Too funny!!!  COngrats on a wonderful shot and a blue ribbon!!<br/>JD</td>', 'Originally posted by kosmikkreeper:YAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! *clears his troat as he walks up to the podium* I would like to thank DPC for giving me the opportunity to let my imagination run free. Without DPC I wouldn''t be the photogrpaher that I am today. I would like to thank my girlfriend for being sooooooooooo patient with me (and often being my model) and understanding my passion for this wonderful art.  I would like to thank my mom and my dad for bringing me into this world.  But most of all.... thank you to all the DPCers for voting my shot into glory!!!! *tear comes to his eye* Go team Coolpix 4500!!!!!!!!! Wait a minute... I might be the only one!!!! ;-) Yanik *leaves the stage with the BLUE RIBBON glued on his forehead*  Too funny!!!  COngrats on a wonderful shot and a blue ribbon!!JD', '2003-12-06 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 0),
